c_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BcTfXWCBbZoQ7kNvwGFEiSo&_nc_oc=AdqFQbrpMyQ0tGNN1heX3U6atDPGX8Q0ZRt4Sztbmc3wnQVdNHNvMnatdxDYdWOioQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_jpOGiCnhfqBBh44zQ3CunIltfbs-VuV2qa9a1TPrVWQ&oe=6A452A23"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "motor grader - trailer cover.png", "id": "840143774838027", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86597262_840143778171360_6047656471363500610_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V2ySQcLCSyoQ7kNvwHFUoB_&_nc_oc=AdrIbAN02zlDbOgROj-Q-zIJaFH1GA8HD2rJSKeHNwia-BmJy5LQXhykRFM8nDxI3mU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-jHV-JchZeYeBMpJ-J3PxRC9O6OIlQc6cnAIRJp0vu3Q&oe=6A4521D0"}, "display_name": "Motor Grader Safety and Operation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Motor graders are versatile machines that play a pivotal role in various projects. Participants will operate a bulldozer and complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of this engaging simulation. \n\n**Overview & Activities:**\n\nParticipants begin with an overview that provides context and helps identify key parts and components outside and inside the vehicle, safety tips, and the basics of a walk-around inspection performed before using any heavy machinery. Participants engage in a sort-and-match activity to reinforce essential controls and their location inside the vehicle. They are then asked to perform a single task to become familiar with operating the vehicle in a VR environment. \n\n**Participant Simulation:**\n\nBefore starting their simulation tasks, participants must wear personal protective equipment (PPE), conduct a walk-around inspection of the vehicle, and complete one task to familiarize themselves with the vehicle's operation. Finally, participants are challenged to complete tasks at an active worksite, including leveling a small hill, moving piles of dirt into targeted areas, and filling a trench with rocks and